             14442\r\nC:\\Projects\\Agent_Workspace\\HG-KSEOS\\var\\swof-construction-002-w2\\w2_10_pack.py                    15245\r\nC:\\Projects\\Agent_Workspace\\HG-KSEOS\\var\\swof-construction-002-w2\\specs\\W2_WO-SWOF-W2-001_SPEC.md  17995\r\nC:\\Projects\\Agent_Workspace\\HG-KSEOS\\var\\swof-construction-002-w2\\specs\\W2_WO-SWOF-W2-002_SPEC.md  11947\r\nC:\\Projects\\Agent_Workspace\\HG-KSEOS\\var\\swof-construction-002-w2\\specs\\W2_WO-SWOF-W2-003_SPEC.md  13318\r\nC:\\Projects\\Agent_Workspace\\HG-KSEOS\\var\\swof-construction-002-w2\\specs\\W2_WO-SWOF-W2-004_SPEC.md   9738\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
