{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\user\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command '$enc = New-Object System.Text.UTF8Encoding($false)\n$init = @'\"'\n\\\"\\\"\\\"SWOF effect / observation / UNKNOWN_EFFECT / reconciliation substrate (W2, WO-SWOF-W2-002).\n\nA STATE MACHINE over immutable effect records, never an executor: nothing in this package\nperforms a network call, a subprocess, a filesystem effect or a broker/business action. A\nprovider response is an OBSERVATION, never world-state truth; only a fresh readback that matches\nthe intended effect may reach RECONCILED, and uncertainty is a first-class terminal state\n(UNKNOWN_EFFECT / PARTIAL_EFFECT). See README.md for the contract per module.\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\n'@\n[System.IO.File]::WriteAllText('C:\\\\Projects\\\\Agent_Workspace\\\\SWOF\\\\src\\\\effect\\\\__init__.py', (\"'$init -replace \"`r`n\",\"`n\") + \"`n\", $enc)\n\n$tinit = @'\"'\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Test package for the SWOF effect substrate (W2, WO-SWOF-W2-002).\\\"\\\"\\\"\n'@\n[System.IO.File]::WriteAllText('C:\\\\Projects\\\\Agent_Workspace\\\\SWOF\\\\src\\\\effect\\\\tests\\\\__init__.py', (\"'$tinit -replace \"`r`n\",\"`n\") + \"`n\", $enc)\nWrite-Output \"wrote init files\"'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
